{"book":"1nephi","heading":{"en":"Sariah complains against Lehi—Both rejoice over the return of their sons—They offer sacrifices—The plates of brass contain writings of Moses and the prophets—The plates identify Lehi as a descendant of Joseph—Lehi prophesies concerning his seed and the preservation of the plates. About 600–592 B.C.","sm":"Ua muimui Sarai ia Liae—Ua fiafia i laua uma i le foi mai o o laua atalii—Ua laua osia ni taulaga—Ua i ai i papatusi apamemea tusitusiga a Mose ma le au perofeta—Ua faailoa mai i papatusi o Liae o se e tupuga mai ia Iosefa—Ua vavalo Liae e uiga i ana fanau ma le faasaoina o papatusi. E tusa o le 600–592 T.L.M.","words":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"complains","sm":"muimui"},{"en":"Sariah","sm":"Sarai"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"against Lehi—","sm":"Liae—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"rejoice","sm":"fiafia"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"laua"},{"en":"both","sm":"uma"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"foi"},{"en":"over the return","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"laua"},{"en":"of their sons—","sm":"atalii—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"laua"},{"en":"they offer","sm":"osia"},{"en":"·","sm":"ni"},{"en":"sacrifices—","sm":"taulaga—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"contain","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"papatusi"},{"en":"in the plates of brass","sm":"apamemea"},{"en":"writings","sm":"tusitusiga"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"of Moses","sm":"Mose"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"au"},{"en":"and the prophets—","sm":"perofeta—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"faailoa"},{"en":"identify","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"the plates","sm":"papatusi"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"Lehi","sm":"Liae"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"tupuga"},{"en":"as a descendant","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"of Joseph—","sm":"Iosefa—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"pr